key distribution (QKD) protocol. The simulation models quantum state preparation, probabilistic measurement    
based on the Born rule, eavesdropping through an intercept-resend attack, channel noise, and classical         
post-processing stages including sifting, quantum bit error rate (QBER) estimation, error reconciliation, and  
